   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2005-06-23.sbd** (recommended): soundboard; 9 songs; 57 min [1]\n- **mmj2005-06-23.flac16**: source not stated; 9 songs; 57 min; rated 4.5/5 by 4 [2]. Said about its sound: The reviewer calls the sound on this recording good; Not very clear but listenable, with plenty of bass and possibly too much bass drum kick; The sound fades in and out at times, as if wind or another disturbance affected it [4][6]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- My Morning Jacket opened for Wilco, and won over several Wilco fans within a few songs [3]\n- Fewer than a thousand people saw the set, which came before Wilco's [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2005-06-23.sbd**: taped by Soundboard; source: soundboard > denon portable DAT recorder [1]\n- **mmj2005-06-23.flac16**: taped by Jon Merin; transferred by Jon Merin; source: Schoeps MK4(DIN)->KC5->CMC6->V3->->VX pocket V2->fujitsu 7010->Wave Lab 5.0 (24/48) [2]. Also: The recording was taped by Jon; The recording was made by Jon [3][5]",
